    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f070e7b7-0a44-5f01-b75a-ec4335d1b2a5" activityNameId="100cb95b-6f02-57e7-9326-7572f4e493e7" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Railway track, ICE</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Railway track, ICE
All data is referred to meter*year. Life time of the rail track infrastructure is assumed to be 100 yrs. I Expenditures due to tunnel construction and bridge construction have been taken into account, according to the share of tunnels and bridges: trenched tunnels: 15%;
UUID: c8b258b8-e666-32d7-89d5-27df6636d2a5
The inventory includes the construction of a ballastless rail track (track bedding, substructures, catenary system) as well as the construction of tunnels and bridges. Further components of rail track infrastructure, such as signalling infrastructure, train overtaking stations, sound insulation walls and buildings (stations, service garages) are not included in this study. Also land use is not considered, but accounted for in the maintenance and operation, railway track.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data represents new  technologies
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c8b258b8-e666-32d7-89d5-27df6636d2a5.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
